# ─── Credential-exclusion rules (SETUP-03) ───────────────────────────────
# This dotfiles repo mirrors config from $HOME and may later be pushed to a
# git remote. Nothing secret may ever be staged. These patterns keep auth
# tokens, SSH material, and environment files out of the tree BEFORE any file
# is copied in. Do NOT paste real token values anywhere in this repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GitHub CLI auth + host config (gh stores the OAuth token in hosts.yml)
gh/
**/hosts.yml

# SSH keys and material
.ssh/
id_*
*.pem
*.key

# Tokens / credentials of any shape
*.token
*_token
*.secret
*credentials*

# Environment files (may carry exported secrets)
.env
.env.*

# macOS filesystem cruft
.DS_Store
